<title>UK: Enterprise Inns year pre-excep profits up.</title>
<headline>Enterprise Inns year pre-excep profits up.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Sept. 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		10.3		   vs 14.3</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 4.5		    vs N/A</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 6.75		   vs N/A</p>
<p> Pretax		     5.6		    vs 7.7</p>
<p> Turnover		   38.1		   vs 24.6</p>
<p>NOTE - Adjusted earnings per share, before exceptional items, was 17.5p versus 14.3p. Pro forma pretax profits before exceptional items was 8.7 million stg versus 7.7 million.</p>
<p> Operating profit	 9.7		    vs 10.4</p>
<p> Exceptional expenses   2.7		    vs nil</p>
<p> Interest payable	 3.8		    vs 2.7</p>
<p> Tax			  1.0		    vs 1.9</p>
<p> Net taxed		  4.5		    vs 5.8</p>
<p> Pay date		   Jan 24, 1997</p>
<p> Div registration date  Dec 3</p>
<p> Ex-div date		Nov 25</p>
<p>NOTE: Operating profit excluding exceptional administration expenses and other items was 12.5 million stg versus 10.4 million. Enterprise Inns Plc is a British pub operator.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
